          "title": "You'll want to know: anrichten",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "anrichten — \"to arrange on the plate; to cause (damage)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sie richtete das Essen auf großen Tellern an. She arranged the food on large plates."
