              "text": "To preheat? (vorheizen.) To grease? (einfetten.) The baking tray? (das Backblech.) The baking dish? (die Auflaufform.) To brown? (bräunen.) To simmer? (köcheln.) To bring to the boil? (aufkochen.) To steam? (dünsten.) To brown quickly? (anbraten.) The lid? (der Deckel.) The sieve? (das Sieb.) To drain? (abgießen.) To drip dry? (abtropfen.) To taste for seasoning? (abschmecken.) To season? (würzen.) To arrange on the plate? (anrichten.) To garnish? (garnieren.) To serve? (servieren.) To cool down? (abkühlen.) Crispy? (knusprig.)"
